			"notes": "## 🎉 Initial Release\n     \n     ### ✨ Features\n     - **Complete web dashboard** with real-time server metrics\n     - **Secure authentication system** with user management\n     - **Admin console** with command execution\n     - **Player teleportation** system\n     - **Performance monitoring** (TPS, CPU, Memory, Entities)\n     - **Mod information** display\n     \n     ### 🔒 Security\n     - Password-based authentication with SHA-256 hashing\n     - Role-based access control (Admin/User)\n     - Session management with secure tokens\n     - Admin protection mechanisms\n     \n     ### �� Installation\n     1. Download the JAR file below\n     2. Place in your server's `mods` folder\n     3. Start server and access dashboard at `http://localhost:8765`\n     4. Login with `admin`/`admin` (change immediately!)\n     \n     ### 📋 Requirements\n     - Minecraft 1.21.8\n     - Fabric Loader >=0.16.5\n     - Fabric API >=0.130.0\n     - Java 21+"
		}
	],
